The trace only shows currently-visible rows; a same-cause sibling can be masked by a bigger one and surface only after it is removed. So when a cluster is chosen, the Optimizer fixes **every** occurrence of the cause in the code (all callsites of the helper), not just the rows listed here — see `roles/optimizer/instructions.md`.

